---
// Toast que aparece en dispositivos táctiles
---

<div id="mobile-tip" class="mobile-toast">
  Pulsa otra vez para leer la crítica
</div>

<style>
  .mobile-toast {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(150px);
    background: #f5d742;
    color: #1c3b70;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-family: "Special Elite", cursive;
    font-weight: bold;
    z-index: 2000;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
    pointer-events: none;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    white-space: nowrap;
    display: none;
  }

  .mobile-toast.visible {
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mobile-toast {
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
